              <td>200-260 GSM</td>
              <td>Grid texture, insulating, breathable</td>
              <td>Thermal wear, winter basics</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
          <caption>All structures produced in-house on 50 circular knitting machines. GSM tolerance guaranteed within ?5%. Custom structures available on request.</caption>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section__container">
