          <h3 class="faq__question">Do you provide knitting services or only finished garments?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">We provide both knitting services and finished garments. As a vertically integrated knitwear factory, we offer fabric knitting, dyeing, cutting, sewing, and finishing. Buyers can source fabric only, finished garments only, or full package production. Knitting capacity is 50,000 kg/month with 50 circular knitting machines.</p>
